Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 23:27:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fixup! chronik: offload ChronikValidationInterface callbacks
 to dedicated worker thread

Charge retained shared ownership metadata and allocator-rounded vector/object storage as well as transaction payloads. Share header-only charge helpers with a regression that fails three minimum-retained-memory assertions before and passes after.
